    "title": "Mod for Teardown in Minecraft",
    "description": "With mod for Teardown in Minecraft PE  you may destroy a plane in Minecraft and get an entirely new experience with destruction! In this incredibly addicting teardown simulator, feel the rush of bringing down airplanes and erecting buildings. In Minecraft, let your imagination run wild and realize your thoughts of destruction. Get the most out of Minecraft's free teardown experience and master the art of tearing down. The Minecraft game is given a special twist with the Teardown mod, which is a ton of fun. Using dynamite, grenades, or even just your own fists, you can obliterate anything in your path! Start demolishing everything around you right away by downloading!",
